5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,We should start by identifying where previous projects failed to meet expectations. I'll look into post-occupancy reviews and survey findings.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I agree with the need for data on usage. I will examine the booking data and timetable records for rooms out of service.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I am concerned about the people maintaining these facilities. I'll check the staffing posts and the technicians' weekly routines.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,We need to understand why our timelines keep slipping. I'll investigate the site diaries and the delivery schedules.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"To ensure the budget is realistic, I'll review the tender records and the renewal reserves for equipment.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
