55,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"The candidates are A: Lab Ventilation, B: Study Commons, C: Path Network, and D: Media Center. I lean toward A or B.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"Given the demand for general rooms and the cost of off-site hiring, B seems the most logical choice.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,George,,A would relieve the bench technicians from those manual routines. That is a priority for me.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,C is too risky given the weather data. D might suffer from the AV funding gap Benjamin mentioned.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A involves mechanical plant, which is getting expensive, but B is a conversion and likely more stable.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@George, A is a mandatory upgrade, which Mizuki noted is more likely to stay on schedule.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""George"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, but B serves more people and addresses the booking shortage I found.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,George,,"@Victoria, the technicians' daily struggle is a hidden cost we can't ignore.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree with Toshio; A is a functional necessity, making it a safer bet for the timeline.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"If we choose A, we must account for the rising cost of ducted plant lots.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I believe A provides the most objective benefit and reliability.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Victoria,,I still believe B addresses the most pressing user need.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,George,,I'm voting for A to support the staff.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,I'll support A for the sake of the schedule.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will vote for B; it avoids the volatile mechanical market.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
